  "_comment_DIAGNOSTICS": "Split three ways — laboratory, imaging, cardiac — because the lexicon resolves better at that granularity, while all three carry AME.EXCL.DIAG: the circular excludes 'diagnostics' as one word and the engine treats them identically. A line billed as 'laboratory and imaging' is a lump, and is left to be categorised by a human rather than claimed by any of the three.",
